---
// Financial Transaction, Clearing and Settlement 3-Stage Lifecycle Diagram Component
---

<figure class="rcs-diag" aria-labelledby="rcs-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="rcs-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 880 180"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="rcs-diag-title rcs-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="rcs-diag-title">金融交易、清算與結算三階段演進圖</title>
    <desc id="rcs-diag-desc">
      展示交易階段凍結額度、清算階段交換對帳數據計算淨應收付、結算階段在銀行間實際劃撥資金的完整週期。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="rcs-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="rcs-diag__arrow-head"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Outer Card Background -->
    <rect
      x="25"
      y="15"
      width="830"
      height="150"
      rx="12"
      class="rcs-diag__card-bg"></rect>

    <!-- Stage 1: Transaction (x: 45, width: 235) -->
    <g transform="translate(45, 30)">
      <rect
        width="235"
        height="100"
        rx="8"
        class="rcs-diag__box rcs-diag__box--blue"></rect>
      <text
        x="117"
        y="28"
        class="rcs-diag__title rcs-diag__title--blue"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        1. 交易階段 (Transaction)
      </text>
      <text x="117" y="52" class="rcs-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle">
        持卡人即時發起支付
      </text>
      <rect x="20" y="64" width="195" height="24" rx="4" class="rcs-diag__pill"
      ></rect>
      <text
        x="117"
        y="80"
        class="rcs-diag__pill-text rcs-diag__pill-text--blue"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        凍結額度 ｜ 授權通過 (Auth)
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow 1 to 2 -->
    <path
      d="M 285 80 L 320 80"
      class="rcs-diag__path"
      marker-end="url(#rcs-arrow)"></path>

    <!-- Stage 2: Clearing (x: 325, width: 235) -->
    <g transform="translate(325, 30)">
      <rect
        width="235"
        height="100"
        rx="8"
        class="rcs-diag__box rcs-diag__box--purple"></rect>
      <text
        x="117"
        y="28"
        class="rcs-diag__title rcs-diag__title--purple"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        2. 清算階段 (Clearing)
      </text>
      <text x="117" y="52" class="rcs-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle">
        T 日結束交換對帳單數據
      </text>
      <rect x="20" y="64" width="195" height="24" rx="4" class="rcs-diag__pill"
      ></rect>
      <text
        x="117"
        y="80"
        class="rcs-diag__pill-text rcs-diag__pill-text--purple"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        計算淨額債權 (Netting)
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Arrow 2 to 3 -->
    <path
      d="M 565 80 L 600 80"
      class="rcs-diag__path"
      marker-end="url(#rcs-arrow)"></path>

    <!-- Stage 3: Settlement (x: 605, width: 230) -->
    <g transform="translate(605, 30)">
      <rect
        width="230"
        height="100"
        rx="8"
        class="rcs-diag__box rcs-diag__box--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="115"
        y="28"
        class="rcs-diag__title rcs-diag__title--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        3. 結算階段 (Settlement)
      </text>
      <text x="115" y="52" class="rcs-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle">
        T+1 日銀行同業清算系統
      </text>
      <rect x="18" y="64" width="194" height="24" rx="4" class="rcs-diag__pill"
      ></rect>
      <text
        x="115"
        y="80"
        class="rcs-diag__pill-text rcs-diag__pill-text--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        頭寸實際劃撥 (Fund Payout)
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Cards) -->
  <div class="rcs-diag__mobile">
    <div class="rcs-mobile-card rcs-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="rcs-mobile-badge rcs-mobile-badge--blue">STAGE 1: 交易</span>
      <h4>1. 交易階段 (Transaction)</h4>
      <p>
        用戶於收銀台點擊結帳。收單行與發卡行即時通訊，校驗餘額並凍結額度（Authorization），返回支付成功。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rcs-mobile-arrow">▼</div>

    <div class="rcs-mobile-card rcs-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="rcs-mobile-badge rcs-mobile-badge--purple"
        >STAGE 2: 清算</span
      >
      <h4>2. 清算階段 (Clearing)</h4>
      <p>
        T
        日深夜收單機構與各發卡行交換批次對帳單，核對手續費並計算出雙方相互的「淨應收或淨應付金額（Netting）」。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rcs-mobile-arrow">▼</div>

    <div class="rcs-mobile-card rcs-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="rcs-mobile-badge rcs-mobile-badge--green">STAGE 3: 結算</span
      >
      <h4>3. 結算階段 (Settlement)</h4>
      <p>
        T+1
        日透過央行大額清算系統（Fedwire、ACH）執行實際的資金頭寸劃撥，款項真正落袋至商戶銀行帳戶。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="rcs-diag-caption" class="rcs-diag__caption">
    圖一：金融核心交易、清算與結算三階段生命週期演進
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rcs-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .rcs-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .rcs-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .rcs-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted, #8b949e);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* SVG Theme Token Styles */
  .rcs-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .rcs-diag__box {
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .rcs-diag__box--blue {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #1f242c);
    stroke: #388bfd;
  }

  .rcs-diag__box--purple {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #241b35);
    stroke: #bc8cff;
  }

  .rcs-diag__box--green {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #1b2e23);
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .rcs-diag__title {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .rcs-diag__title--blue {
    fill: #58a6ff;
  }

  .rcs-diag__title--purple {
    fill: #d2a8ff;
  }

  .rcs-diag__title--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .rcs-diag__desc {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
  }

  .rcs-diag__pill {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #10141a);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
    stroke-width: 1px;
  }

  .rcs-diag__pill-text {
    font-family:
      ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .rcs-diag__pill-text--blue {
    fill: #58a6ff;
  }

  .rcs-diag__pill-text--purple {
    fill: #bc8cff;
  }

  .rcs-diag__pill-text--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .rcs-diag__path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong, #58a6ff);
    stroke-width: 2px;
  }

  .rcs-diag__arrow-head {
    fill: var(--dg-rule-strong, #58a6ff);
  }

  /* Light Theme Adjustments */
  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcs-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #ffffff);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #d0d7de);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcs-diag__box--blue {
    fill: #eff7ff;
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcs-diag__box--purple {
    fill: #fbefff;
    stroke: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcs-diag__box--green {
    fill: #dafbe1;
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcs-diag__title--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcs-diag__title--purple {
    fill: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcs-diag__title--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcs-diag__pill {
    fill: #ffffff;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #d0d7de);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcs-diag__pill-text--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcs-diag__pill-text--purple {
    fill: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcs-diag__pill-text--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcs-diag__path {
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcs-diag__arrow-head {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  /* Mobile Responsive View */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .rcs-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .rcs-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .rcs-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
      background: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    }

    .rcs-mobile-card--blue {
      border-color: #388bfd;
      background: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.05);
    }

    .rcs-mobile-card--purple {
      border-color: #bc8cff;
      background: rgba(188, 140, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .rcs-mobile-card--green {
      border-color: #238636;
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.05);
    }

    .rcs-mobile-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.125rem 0.4rem;
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
    }

    .rcs-mobile-badge--blue {
      background: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.2);
      color: #58a6ff;
    }

    .rcs-mobile-badge--purple {
      background: rgba(188, 140, 255, 0.2);
      color: #d2a8ff;
    }

    .rcs-mobile-badge--green {
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.2);
      color: #3fb950;
    }

    .rcs-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink, #f0f6fc);
    }

    .rcs-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
    }

    .rcs-mobile-arrow {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-muted, #8b949e);
    }
  }
</style>
